old\">x</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> vanishes\nidentically.”</li>\n<li>State <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-haynsworth\">@thm-haynsworth</span>, with all\nhypotheses.</li>\n<li>A congruence preserves the inertia of a Hermitian matrix. Does it\npreserve the eigenvalues, the trace, or the rank? Justify each\nanswer.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch17-variational/10-inertia-revisited.html"}